usage: __main__.py [-h] --video VIDEO --scene {high,courtside,personal}
                   --output OUTPUT [--court COURT]

Run a selected rally scenario on a local video; export remains a product
choice.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --video VIDEO
  --scene {high,courtside,personal}
  --output OUTPUT
  --court COURT         Four normalized [x,y] corners as JSON
